<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ausdoc down on Brambles comment.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ausdoc down on Brambles comment.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in business services group Ausdoc Group Ltd fell nearly 10 percent in early trade on Wednesday following Brambles Industries Ltd comment after Tuesday's close that it would not raise its bid for Ausdoc.</p>
<p>At 10.25 a.m. (2325 GMT), Ausdoc shares were 22 cents or 9.91 percent lower at A$2.00, the same level as Brambles offer price. Brambles said on Tuesday it would not raise its offer for Ausdoc and its bid would lapse at the end of the month.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
